=== why HAC matters here ===
   naive SE 0.00563 -> HAC SE 0.00881 (1.56x)
   naive t  +12.50    -> HAC t  +7.99
   The naive SE assumes independent daily ICs; the 4-day overlapping label makes them
   strongly autocorrelated, so only the HAC number is reportable.

